Z||000011||Jaygee79||08-30-2001||05:47 PM||||They were talking about this on a local radio station.  There's a story behind it.  This guy needs prosthetic legs but his insurance won't cover it and he can't afford it.  So he has this thing where for $20 you can sign up to watch him cut off his feet and when he raises enough money he will cut them off himself with a guillotine and use the money to pay for the new prosthetics.  Interesting, huh?<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="purple">Ranger Jaime<BR>AOL IM: Jaygee79<BR>ICQ: 85931334</FONT><BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/index.html" TARGET=_blank>Jaygee79's Web Page</A><BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/peggypic.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by Jaygee79 (edited 08-30-2001).]||||reg||1
