Z||000018||Mach10||08-30-2001||09:18 PM||||What to "balls" and "guts" have to do with it? Is it bravery or stupidity?<P>Jump off a cliff. Why not? You chicken? <BR>No, you're not a coward 'cos you won't jump off a cliff. You're smarter than that. This is the same thing.<P>This man is proposing to mangle his own body, in exchange for cash. Fair enough, he's entitled to do whatever he wants to his own body. But to appeal to the morbid fascination of the masses, and try to profit from this? That' insane. <P>This guy is an idiot. It's unfortunate that he had the accident. It's unfortunate that his insurance won't cover his operation/prosthetics/rehab. But that's his lot. You'd think that he could find a better way to do this rather than make himself a celebrity. ||||reg||4
